"document:0:576:0":{"key":"document:0:576:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"0","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"<style=\"stress\">课题编号：</style>S-E5003\n<style=\"stress\">课题名称：</style>群体魔力共振式文档索引与自动归类术式\n研究目的： 鉴于魔法事务司行政效率低下，人工处理琐碎文书严重浪费高阶施法者的精神力。本术式旨在通过低能耗魔力场，自动识别关键词并分类加急公文。\n<style=\"stress\">实验观测：</style>\n注入1.5刻度的奥术触媒，可覆盖司内所有的文档柜。\n通过提前设置召唤词（如：魔力、边境、研究），术式可将对应纸张自动平移至对应处理区。\n<style=\"stress\">负面效应：</style> 术式运行期间，周边的人员会感到轻微的被窥视感，这是魔力波动的正常影响，无需理会。\n<style=\"stress\">结论：</style>  该术式已趋于完美。若推广至各行政部门，预计可节省一半的人力成本。然而，由于大多数宫廷魔法师（特别是像达利那样的人）抓不准共振频率，该术式目前仅限本人使用。","textdes_id":"576","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:1:1711023201:1":{"key":"say:1:1711023201:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711023201","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"迪尔格雷以提升行政效率为借口，将这种带有明显监控性质的...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1711023202:1":{"key":"say:2:1711023202:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711023202","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"他的这些举动，名正言顺地将整个魔法事务司置于了自己的监...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","d